regex = redge ex
nginx = engine ex
PostgreSQL = post gres
MySQL = my sequel
Kubernetes = koo ber net eez
Ubuntu = oo boon too
Linux = linnux
GNU = guh new
cache = cash
Chmod = C H mod
sudo = soo doo
tmux = tee mux
vim = vim
Xcode = X code
macOS = mac O S
iOS = i O S
C# = C sharp
C++ = C plus plus
F# = F sharp
Node.js = node jay ess
